WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Klyndb: a free, open-source alternative to DBeaver. Edited native screenshot walkthrough.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
SQL tabs. Real results. Actual native macOS source, read-only SQLite and synthetic customers/orders.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Filter MongoDB documents. Actual native app, real MongoDB and synthetic records.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Aggregate documents. EU 102 and US 103 from a real native read-only MongoDB pipeline.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Review production writes. Native MongoDB review, canceled without writing.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Explore Redis keys, types and TTLs. Native app, real Redis and synthetic values.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Inspect original bytes. The native Redis string is exactly 0x6100ff.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Review native Redis data commands. Exact production arguments, canceled without execution.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Your SQL. Your confirmation rules. Native source Settings, production review and four destructive SQL categories.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Make the keyboard yours. Twelve customizable workspace and SQL bindings in native source Settings.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Nine engines. One workspace. Preview 2 is available for macOS Apple Silicon; the new Settings shown here require the current source build. Star github.com/OthmaneBlial/klyndb.
